/AppData/extensions/*/servers.json
# 拓展正式目录是安装时从 _builtin 下载源拷贝生成的，仓库只保留下载源与清单
/AppData/extensions/*/
!/AppData/extensions/_builtin/
/AppData/extensions/installed.json
